00:47:17.720 --> 00:47:20.180
- Thank you.

00:47:20.180 --> 00:47:21.856
[CROWD CHATTER]

00:47:41.200 --> 00:47:42.985
- Thank you.

00:47:42.985 --> 00:47:44.930
- Thank you very much.

00:47:44.930 --> 00:47:46.450
